situation is a small shell init and service manager (PID 1) from derive linux
upstream: https://codeberg.org/derivelinux/situation
license: ISC-0
ported to hdxp by: davy
 
boot with init=/bin/situation on the kernel command line, or leave the
default, since this port also links /sbin/init to it.
manage services with sctl (see: sctl list).
 
